# This file is intentionally empty of auth.
#
# Publishes use npm Trusted Publishing (OIDC): the npm CLI in CI auto-detects
# the GitHub Actions OIDC token via `id-token: write` on the release job and
# exchanges it for a short-lived registry token. The previous _authToken line
# referencing ${NPM_TOKEN} is gone on purpose — without a token env var set in
# the workflow, it would resolve to the literal string "${NPM_TOKEN}" and fail.
#
# The changesets GitHub Action would otherwise recreate this file with
# `_authToken=${process.env.NPM_TOKEN}` (see changesets/action#NPM_TOKEN
# handling), so we keep an existing file with no auth line to prevent that.
#
